; This directory has no dune stanza of its own: `(include_subdirs unqualified)`
; in `lib/symbaroum/dune` sweeps it into the one library. The file exists only to
; say so, because an empty `model/` next to a `codec/` that also has no stanza is
; the kind of thing a reader checks twice.
;
; The layering rule for this directory, which is stricter than the rest:
;
;   model/ depends on scalars, `combatant` and `encounter` -- and on NOTHING in
;   `transitions/` or `codec/`.
;
; That is what keeps the DP testable and benchmarkable on its own, and it is why
; `Difficulty.analyze` takes an `Encounter.t` rather than a `World.t`.
